{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118857","id":3568697141,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Utf81","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118857","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118857.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118857.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118857","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118857/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118857/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118857/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4b94f459f43ad5e1cec71a03897768c780c9212b","number":118857,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix and clean up clearcoat reflection probe process","user":{"login":"LiveTrower","id":48926464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4OTI2NDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48926464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower","html_url":"https://github.com/LiveTrower","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LiveTrower/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR implements the following changes that were missed in PR #111464:\r\n\r\n- Removed the `specular_light` parameter from the reflection_process() function, as it became obsolete in PR #100241.\r\n- Removed the `cc_specular_light` parameter as well.\r\n- Removed the `if (reflections.data[ref_index].exterior)` check for the clearcoat, following its removal in PR #100241.\r\n- Replaced the `blend` variable in clearcoat reflections with `cc_reflection.a` to maintain consistency with the main reflection implementation.\r\n-  Changed value type for `cc_reflection_accum` and `cc_reflection` from vec3 to vec4.\r\n- Moved the clearcoat reflection operations inside their own conditionals: `if (reflections.data[ref_index].intensity > 0.0 && cc_reflection_accum.a < half(1.0))`, `if (cc_reflection_accum.a < 1.0)`, and `if (cc_reflection_accum.a > 0.0)`.\r\n- Added the operation `cc_reflection_accum.rgb = cc_specular_light * (1.0 - cc_reflection_accum.a) + cc_reflection_accum.rgb;` to prevent seams artifacts in the reflection.\r\n\r\nHere are some before-and-after comparisons.\r\n|Before|After|\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n|<img width=\"890\" height=\"829\" alt=\"before\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f4f0faf-7b96-4742-a293-ba8b35af8c24\" />|<img width=\"859\" height=\"831\" alt=\"after\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/381897ec-21f9-40bd-86cd-a2cbc2c257da\" />|\r\n|<img width=\"791\" height=\"797\" alt=\"before2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa64d6c5-7ca3-45af-b5e0-4fbf1a01971b\" />|<img width=\"791\" height=\"797\" alt=\"after2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d446f9c9-cb49-4c47-a838-3f99ec124932\" />|","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-04-22T17:31:44Z","updated_at":"2026-04-27T19:53:13Z","closed_at":"2026-04-27T17:08:32Z","merged_at":"2026-04-27T17:08:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"75444feae7304924316f09ce5abb48685294d8f2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"LiveTrower:clearcoat-reflection-fixes","ref":"clearcoat-reflection-fixes","repo":{"id":841147304,"node_id":"R_kg